# generated lockstep vectors: only vectors.lock.json (hashes + commands) is tracked ...
ip/*/vectors/*
!ip/*/vectors/vectors.lock.json
# ... but `source: committed` sets (the consumer's export, rule 3) are tracked; every
# ip.yaml with committed sets must re-include its set directories here
# (tests/test_vectors_lock.py::test_committed_sets_are_tracked checks it).
!ip/halo_*/vectors/*
# lockstep's per-IP flock file (tools/lockstep.py vectors_lock)
ip/*/vectors/.lockstep.lock
# simulation / synthesis outputs (CI uploads them as artifacts)
results/lockstep/
results/synth/logs/
obj_dir/
obj_*/
*.vvp
*.vcd
*.fst
# downloaded liberty files and sibling checkouts
third_party/
_siblings/
# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
